WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:04.580
At the railway station, Jan is in a hurry.

2
00:00:05.430 --> 00:00:07.790
Przepraszam, czy tu można kupić bilet?

3
00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:10.600
Tak. Dokąd chce pan jechać?

4
00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:13.530
Muszę być w Gdańsku o piątej.

5
00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:17.840
An obligation. Now listen to her advice.

6
00:00:18.490 --> 00:00:21.690
W takim razie powinien pan jechać pociągiem o pierwszej.

7
00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:24.660
Dobrze. Poproszę jeden bilet.

8
00:00:26.410 --> 00:00:28.810
Trzeba kupić bilet.

9
00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:33.810
Some of these words stay the same for every person.

10
00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:38.360
They name a rule, not the person who follows it.

11
00:00:38.710 --> 00:00:42.430
The others change their ending like any verb.

12
00:00:44.630 --> 00:00:47.550
You have to go now. Say it.

13
00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:51.770
Muszę już iść.

14
00:00:52.570 --> 00:00:56.130
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

15
00:00:57.930 --> 00:00:59.650
Muszę już iść.

16
00:01:01.650 --> 00:01:03.730
Ask if you may sit here.

17
00:01:06.230 --> 00:01:08.030
Czy mogę tu usiąść?

18
00:01:08.830 --> 00:01:12.390
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

19
00:01:14.190 --> 00:01:15.990
Czy mogę tu usiąść?

20
00:01:17.990 --> 00:01:21.550
Now practise with the exercises below the video.
